# Files excluded from the Vercel deploy bundle. They stay in the repo/working
# tree (nothing is deleted) but are not shipped to production. This removes
# ~120MB of dead weight from the deploy. See afterslim_performance_2026-06.md
# (P1) and afterslim_code_audit_2026-06.md (L1).

# Playwright/automation debug screenshots — never referenced by any page.
.daemon/

# Dead-weight media: verified not referenced by any live page (only by the
# superseded index-v*/v* versions below).
images/bacteriagif.gif
images/scroller-*.png
images/highlight-*.png
videos/*.mov

# Superseded landing-page versions. Also 301-redirected to / in vercel.json;
# excluding them here keeps the old copy/claims/prices out of the deploy
# entirely (compliance + SEO duplicate-content).
index-v1.html
index-v3.html
v2.html
v4.html
v5.html
index.html.bak-before-v6-hero

# Build/edit scripts and the local dev server — not needed in a static deploy.
*.py

# Audit backups — never ship (would expose old copy/prices at a public URL).
*.bak-audit-*
